    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d149">

                <pb facs="0142" n="132" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg132"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/10–1749</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State of a Conversation
                        With President Truman</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1949-10-17">October 17, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">UK <hi rendition="#small-caps">Recognition of China</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The President had already seen my telegram to Mr. Bevin on the China recognition
                        matter.<anchor n="30" xml:id="d149-f1"/> He had noted that the Soviet
                    reaction was that the British note amounted to recognition. He thought that the
                    British had not played very squarely with us on this matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>D[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ean</hi>] A[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >cheson</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
